{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12107150","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12107150","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1210715001:0":{"text":"ああ、オマエか。なに？盗み聞きが趣味なの？","source_cn":"啊，是你。你很喜欢偷听吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C517411FDC63387","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210715002:0":{"text":"ナーラ、実験素材を二体も無駄にしたわね。","source_cn":"奈拉，你浪费了两个材料。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DBB0A7EA4C71D0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210715003:0":{"text":"ワタシが捕まえたんだから、どうしようとワタシの勝手でしょ？船長もそう言ってたわ！","source_cn":"那两个家伙是我抓的，任我处置，船长说我有这个权利！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3123D32DEE8B70FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210715004:0":{"text":"もうすぐ決戦の日だというのに……船長は貴重な力をあなたに使ったのよ、彼を失望させないでちょうだい。","source_cn":"……决战日快到了，船长把那么珍贵的力量用在了你身上，别...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD71967AFD3995192","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210715005:0":{"text":"うるさいなぁ、もう聞き飽きたっつーの。","source_cn":"真吵啊，这些话早都听腻了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE728BA3013531394","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210715006:0":{"text":"ていうか、船長に失望されるのが怖いのはそっちでしょ？","source_cn":"我看是你……很害怕让他失望吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86E62FD4F2B111B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210715007:0":{"text":"言葉には気を付けなさい。","source_cn":"真是无礼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FFEFBE70716054B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210715008:0":{"text":"はっ、船長がいなかったら、今頃オマエの首はワタシのフックの先にぶら下がってるわよ！","source_cn":"要不是船长拦着，你的头早被我割下来十次了。串在钩索上会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5471649283677E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210715009:0":{"text":"いい加減にしなさい。忠告はしたわよ……","source_cn":"够了。该提醒的我都提醒了，你好自为之。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E394BC5EA7770BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210715010:0":{"text":"はいはい、じゃぁね～！","source_cn":"啊哈哈，慢走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF1C5E713267DA6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1210715011:0":{"text":"誰か～この二人を……いや、まてよ……","source_cn":"来人，把这两个人……我想想……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70357E2E39BF2BF3","va